# Build context is the repository root (see sheetsmith-java/Dockerfile).
# Keep it small: everything here is either rebuilt inside the image or must never ship in one.

### Build output — regenerated by the image build ###
**/target/
**/node_modules/
**/dist/
**/build/

### Runtime data — never ship someone's spreadsheets into an image ###
uploads/
results/
sessions/
**/uploads/
**/results/
**/sessions/
*.xlsx
!**/src/test/resources/*.xlsx

### Secrets ###
.env
**/.env
*.env.local

### VCS / tooling / editors ###
.git/
.gitignore
.gitattributes
.github/
.idea/
.vscode/
.claude/
.sonar/
**/.sonar/
.mvn/
**/.mvn/
*.iml

